<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to auction 5yr bonds of HUF 5bln on Jan 30.</title>
<headline>Hungary to auction 5yr bonds of HUF 5bln on Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will auction five billion forints worth of five-year government bonds of the 2001/C series on January 30, the Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Date of issue		3 February 1997</p>
<p>    Date of maturity	   12 December 2001</p>
<p>    Bills on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Minimum net price	  94.23 pct</p>
<p>NOTE -  The bond bears an annual interest of 15 percent, to be paid twice annually starting with June 12, 1997. @</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
